{97}{Several generations ago, there lived a great elven wizard name K'an T'au.  He brought into being a staff of great power.  The tales told say that whomever held the staff could perceive all things hidden.  Additionally, the staff was rumored to be capable of instantaneously shifting it's bearer from one location to another.  Many were the enemies that tried to obtain the staff, yet all failed.}{Several generations ago, there lived a great elven wizard name K'an T'au.  He brought into being a staff of great power.  The tales told say that whomever held the staff could perceive all things hidden.  Additionally, the staff was rumored to be capable of instantaneously shifting it's bearer from one location to another.  Many were the enemies that tried to obtain the staff, yet all failed.}{}{}{}{}
{98}{Please continue.}{}{5}{}{101}{}
